@lang en
IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `vn11-nouns`
IMPORT `vn11-art01-02-definitions`

-- Manulife Vietnam term life product terms, row VN-11: Article 8 (beneficiaries), Article 9 (Age
-- and sex), Article 10 (incontestability), Article 11 (suicide), Article 12 (no participation in
-- profits) and Article 13 (no surrender value).

§ `Article 8 — Beneficiaries`

§§ `Art 8 — who the beneficiary is, and how the benefit is divided`

-- src:215 | Người thụ hưởng là người được Bên mua bảo
-- src:216 | hiểm chỉ định trong Hợp đồng bảo hiểm hoặc do
-- src:222 | Nếu có từ hai Người thụ hưởng trở lên thì Quyền
-- src:223 | lợi bảo hiểm do tử vong sẽ được chia đều cho tất
-- Two or more beneficiaries share equally unless the contract or the designation provides
-- otherwise. The document does not say who is paid when no beneficiary is designated or all have
-- died (finding 6), nor how to divide when shares are stated for some beneficiaries and not others,
-- nor what follows from stated shares that do not make up the whole; each is a named refusal.
@ref Art 8, src:222-227
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 8 does not say who receives the death benefit when no beneficiary is designated` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 8 does not say who receives the death benefit when no beneficiary is designated"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 8 does not say how to divide the death benefit when shares are stated for some beneficiaries only` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 8 does not say how to divide the death benefit when shares are stated for some beneficiaries only"

GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 8 does not say what follows when the shares stated do not make up the whole death benefit` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 8 does not say what follows when the shares stated do not make up the whole death benefit"

GIVEN `the designation` IS A `A beneficiary designation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`no share stated for` `the designation` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the designation`'s `share stated`
    WHEN NOTHING      THEN TRUE
    WHEN JUST `share` THEN FALSE

GIVEN `the designation` IS A `A beneficiary designation`
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the share stated for` `the designation` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the designation`'s `share stated`
    WHEN NOTHING      THEN `Art 8 does not say how to divide the death benefit when shares are stated for some beneficiaries only`
    WHEN JUST `share` THEN `share`

@ref Art 8, src:222-227
GIVEN `the beneficiaries` IS A LIST OF `A beneficiary designation`
      `the death benefit` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
`Art 8 — the amounts paid to the beneficiaries, in the order they are named` `the beneficiaries` `the death benefit` MEANS
  BRANCH
    IF null `the beneficiaries`
        THEN `Art 8 does not say who receives the death benefit when no beneficiary is designated`
    IF all (GIVEN b YIELD `no share stated for` b) `the beneficiaries`
        THEN map (GIVEN b YIELD `the death benefit` DIVIDED BY count `the beneficiaries`) `the beneficiaries`
    IF any (GIVEN b YIELD `no share stated for` b) `the beneficiaries`
        THEN `Art 8 does not say how to divide the death benefit when shares are stated for some beneficiaries only`
    IF NOT (sum (map (GIVEN b YIELD `the share stated for` b) `the beneficiaries`) EQUALS 1)
        THEN `Art 8 does not say what follows when the shares stated do not make up the whole death benefit`
    OTHERWISE map (GIVEN b YIELD `the death benefit` TIMES `the share stated for` b) `the beneficiaries`

§§ `Art 8 — changing the beneficiary`

-- src:229 | Bên mua bảo hiểm có thể thay đổi Người thụ
-- src:230 | hưởng bằng văn bản với sự chấp thuận của Công
-- src:231 | ty mà không cần có sự đồng ý của bất kỳ Người
-- No beneficiary's consent is needed, so no field records one. The Company's approval is given
-- with no criteria (finding 7). Law 08/2022/QH15 Art 41(3) asks instead for the insured's written
-- consent and a notice to the insurer (LAW fork L7).
@ref Art 8, src:228-232
GIVEN `the change` IS A `A change of beneficiary`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 8 — the change of beneficiary takes effect` `the change` MEANS
        `the change`'s `made while the insured was alive`
    AND `the change`'s `in writing`
    AND `the change`'s `approved by the Company`

-- src:233 | Công ty sẽ không chịu trách nhiệm về tính hiệu
-- Inert: a disclaimer, which decides no question the encoding asks.
@ref Art 8, src:233-235
GIVETH A STRING
`Art 8 — the Company's responsibility for the validity of a designation` MEANS
    "none: the Company is not responsible for the validity of the designation or declaration of a beneficiary"

§ `Article 9 — Age and sex`

§§ `Art 9, first paragraph — a misstated Age or sex is corrected`

-- src:237 | Nếu khai báo sai Tuổi và/hoặc giới tính của Người
-- src:238 | được bảo hiểm trong Đơn yêu cầu bảo hiểm thì
-- src:243 | nhiều hơn khoản phí bảo hiểm phải đóng, Công ty
-- src:244 | sẽ hoàn trả lại khoản phí thừa không có lãi. Nếu
-- src:246 | hiểm phải đóng, Công ty sẽ điều chỉnh giảm số
-- src:247 | tiền bảo hiểm xuống phù hợp với khoản phí bảo
-- Amounts and benefits are reckoned on the premium payable at the true Age and sex. Overpaid: the
-- excess is refunded without interest, and the sum insured stands. Underpaid: the sum insured is
-- reduced "phù hợp với khoản phí bảo hiểm đã đóng", read as in proportion to the premium paid
-- (fork F14). The premiums are the totals paid and payable over the same period (vn11-nouns.l4).
@ref Art 9, src:237-248
GIVEN `the sum insured`                             IS A NUMBER
      `the premium paid`                            IS A NUMBER
      `the premium payable at the true Age and sex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 9 — the sum insured after the misstatement is corrected` `the sum insured` `the premium paid` `the premium payable at the true Age and sex` MEANS
    IF   `the premium paid` LESS THAN `the premium payable at the true Age and sex`
    THEN `the sum insured` TIMES (`the premium paid` DIVIDED BY `the premium payable at the true Age and sex`)
    ELSE `the sum insured`

@ref Art 9, src:242-244
GIVEN `the premium paid`                            IS A NUMBER
      `the premium payable at the true Age and sex` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 9 — the excess premium refunded, without interest` `the premium paid` `the premium payable at the true Age and sex` MEANS
    IF   `the premium paid` GREATER THAN `the premium payable at the true Age and sex`
    THEN `the premium paid` MINUS `the premium payable at the true Age and sex`
    ELSE 0

§§ `Art 9, second paragraph — a misstated Age outside the insurable Ages`

-- src:250 | hiểm, mà Tuổi thực không nằm trong nhóm tuổi
-- src:251 | có thể được bảo hiểm (như được quy định tại Điều
-- src:252 | 1.3), thì Công ty sẽ hoàn lại 100% số phí bảo
-- The refund is the one Art 3(c) closes with (vn11-art03-benefits.l4). The paragraph has no time
-- limit: Art 10's two years do not shorten it (finding 8).
@ref Art 9, src:249-254
GIVEN `the form`           IS A `The application`
      `the insured person` IS A `The insured`
      `the page`           IS A `The contract page`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 9 — a misstated Age, and the true Age at issue outside Art 1.3` `the form` `the insured person` `the page` MEANS
        `the form`'s `Age misstated in it`
    AND NOT `Art 1.3 — an Age from 0 to 60` (`the Age of` `the insured person` `on` (`the page`'s `issue date`))

§ `Article 10 — Incontestability`

§§ `Art 10 — the Company's right to treat the contract as void, and its end`

-- src:257 | Công ty có quyền xem Hợp đồng bảo hiểm là vô
-- src:258 | hiệu nếu Bên mua bảo hiểm hoặc Người được bảo
-- src:259 | hiểm không khai báo hoặc khai báo sai bất kỳ
-- src:266 | quan cũng không khai báo việc không khai báo
-- src:270 | hiểm vì lý do không khai báo hoặc khai báo sai,
-- src:271 | sau khi Hợp đồng bảo hiểm có hiệu lực 2 (hai)
-- src:272 | năm kể từ ngày cấp Hợp đồng bảo hiểm nếu Hợp
-- src:274 | khôi phục hiệu lực Hợp đồng bảo hiểm gần nhất
-- src:275 | (nếu có), trong thời gian Người được bảo hiểm
-- The right: material information not disclosed or misstated, and that omission not itself
-- declared. Its end: except for fraud, once the contract has been in force for two years from the
-- issue date or the most recent reinstatement, during the insured's lifetime. A death on or before
-- the last day of the two years is inside them (fork F2), so the right survives it. "có tầm quan
-- trọng" (material) is a judgement recorded as found. Age and sex are left to Art 9 (fork F11).
-- What is returned when the right is used is not said (finding 5).
@ref Art 10, src:268-276
GIVEN `the page`   IS A `The contract page`
      `the record` IS A `The premium record`
GIVETH A DATE
`Art 10 — the day the two years run from` `the page` `the record` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the record`'s `date of the most recent reinstatement`
    WHEN NOTHING                 THEN `the page`'s `issue date`
    WHEN JUST `the reinstatement` THEN `the reinstatement`

@ref Art 10, src:268-276
GIVEN `the page`   IS A `The contract page`
      `the record` IS A `The premium record`
GIVETH A DATE
`Art 10 — the last day of the two years` `the page` `the record` MEANS
    `add years` (`Art 10 — the day the two years run from` `the page` `the record`) 2

@ref Art 10, src:257-276
GIVEN `the facts`    IS A `The disclosure record`
      `the page`     IS A `The contract page`
      `the record`   IS A `The premium record`
      `the day of death` IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 10 — the Company may treat the contract as void` `the facts` `the page` `the record` `the day of death` MEANS
        `the facts`'s `material information not disclosed or misstated`
    AND `the facts`'s `the omission not itself declared by the person concerned`
    AND (    "except for fraud"     ... `the facts`'s `fraud`
         OR  "within the two years" ... `the day of death` AT MOST `Art 10 — the last day of the two years` `the page` `the record`)

@ref Art 10, src:257-267
GIVEN a IS A TYPE
GIVETH AN a
`Art 10 does not say what is returned to the policyholder when the Company treats the contract as void` MEANS
    REFUSE "Art 10 does not say what is returned to the policyholder when the Company treats the contract as void"

@ref Art 10, src:257-267
GIVETH A NUMBER
`Art 10 — the premium returned when the Company treats the contract as void` MEANS
    `Art 10 does not say what is returned to the policyholder when the Company treats the contract as void`

§ `Article 11 — Suicide`

§§ `Art 11 — suicide within two years of issue or reinstatement`

-- src:278 | Nếu Người được bảo hiểm tử vong do tự tử trong
-- src:279 | thời gian 2 (hai) năm kể từ ngày cấp Hợp đồng
-- src:280 | bảo hiểm hoặc ngày khôi phục hiệu lực Hợp đồng
-- "trong thời gian 2 (hai) năm kể từ ngày cấp ... hoặc ngày khôi phục hiệu lực": the two years
-- from the issue date, or from a reinstatement; both ends inside (fork F2). A death before the
-- issue date is not within two years "from" it, on the words (fork F13, finding 4). Whether the
-- insured was of sound mind is not read: "cho dù ... có bị mất trí hay không".
-- The Law counts from the payment of the first premium (LAW fork L2).
@ref Art 11, src:278-288
GIVEN `the start` IS A DATE
      `the day`   IS A DATE
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 11 — the 2 years from` `the start` `include` `the day` MEANS
        `the day` AT LEAST `the start`
    AND `the day` AT MOST  `add years` `the start` 2

@ref Art 11, src:278-288
GIVEN `the death`  IS A `The death`
      `the page`   IS A `The contract page`
      `the record` IS A `The premium record`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 11 — a suicide within 2 years of the issue date or of a reinstatement` `the death` `the page` `the record` MEANS
        `the death`'s `by suicide`
    AND (    `Art 11 — the 2 years from` (`the page`'s `issue date`) `include` (`the death`'s `date of death`)
         OR  `within 2 years from the reinstatement`)
    WHERE
        `within 2 years from the reinstatement` MEANS
            CONSIDER `the record`'s `date of the most recent reinstatement`
            WHEN NOTHING                  THEN FALSE
            WHEN JUST `the reinstatement` THEN `Art 11 — the 2 years from` `the reinstatement` `include` (`the death`'s `date of death`)

§ `Article 12 — No participation in profits`
-- src:290 | Điều khoản này không quy định việc tham gia
-- src:291 | chia bất kỳ khoản lãi nào từ Công ty.
@ref Art 12, src:290-291
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 12 — the contract shares in the Company's profits` MEANS FALSE

§ `Article 13 — Surrender value and non-forfeiture benefits`
-- src:294 | Hợp đồng bảo hiểm của điều khoản này không có
-- src:295 | Giá trị hoàn lại và Các quyền lợi không bị tước
-- So a policyholder who ends the contract after the 14 days of Art 4 (Art 18(iv)) is paid nothing.
@ref Art 13, src:294-296
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 13 — the contract has a surrender value` MEANS FALSE

@ref Art 13, src:294-296
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`Art 13 — the contract has non-forfeiture benefits` MEANS FALSE
